"ftv_TheDesignNetwork_us","title":"Tiny BNB","released":"2026-11-28T12:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T12:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T13:00:00Z","overview":"Levi explores two whimsical retreats plucked straight from a fairytale he starts in Rising Fawn at the Laurel Zome, a stunning geometric dome then Levi discovers the Merry Mushroom, a charming tiny home designed to resemble woodland fungi.","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_TheDesignNetwork_us","title":"DIY House Call With Kylie Katich","released":"2026-11-28T13:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T13:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T13:30:00Z","overview":"Ashie wants a bedroom her daughters will never forget, and Kylie brings the magic to life with patterned wallpaper, dreamy canopies and a custom closet makeover, the room transforms into a warm, playful space full of fairytale vibes.","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_TheDesignNetwork_us","title":"DIY House Call With Kylie Katich","released":"2026-11-28T13:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T13:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T14:00:00Z","overview":"Kylie helps her friend Lucy transform her bedroom into a warm retreat filled with velvet textures and bold personality from a custom DIY headboard to a dream closet makeover, the space becomes a stylish reflection of Lucy's creative life.","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_TheDesignNetwork_us","title":"DIY House Call With Kylie Katich","released":"2026-11-28T14:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T14:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T14:30:00Z","overview":"Courtney Cahoon calls Kylie for a DIY House Call to help transform her blank dining room into a warm Mediterranean-inspired gathering space with lime-washed columns and timeless furniture, Kylie creates a homey, elevated room designed for hosting.","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_TheDesignNetwork_us","title":"The Design Fix: Holiday","released":"2026-11-28T14:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T14:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T15:00:00Z","overview":"Designer Ashley Childers shares holiday entertaining ideas and DIYs watch as she builds a snack bar and sets a cozy Christmas brunch table learn how to prepare her signature mulled wine alongside budget-friendly holiday DIY projects.","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_TheDesignNetwork_us","title":"The Design Fix: Holiday","released":"2026-11-28T15:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T15:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T15:30:00Z","overview":"Designer Ashley Childers kicks off the festive season by transforming her front porch into a classic Christmas showpiece step-by-step, Ashley reveals how to hang and layer lush garlands she unpacks her top eight holiday styling secrets.","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_TheDesignNetwork_us","title":"The Reveal","released":"2026-11-28T15:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T15:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T16:00:00Z","overview":"Step inside Noyack Cottage, a stunning Sag Harbor vacation home transformed by Cara Woodhouse known for her emotionally resonant environments, Cara blends bold forms, layered textures, and a joyful color palette to create a cozy cottage experience.","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_TheDesignNetwork_us","title":"The Reveal","released":"2026-11-28T16:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T16:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T16:30:00Z","overview":"Designer Nikki Baize is a woman of many talents and her home is a bold blend of all the things she loves: grounded in Asian influences, rich in Wabi-Sabi philosophy, and bursting with color.","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_TheDesignNetwork_us","title":"The Reveal","released":"2026-11-28T16:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T16:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T17:00:00Z","overview":"In this South Carolina stunner, designer Mary Welch Fox turns up the volume on style with bold choices, fearless edge, and serious design swagger this home doesn't just bend the rules-it breaks them wide open.","genres":["Docs & Lifestyle"]},{"id":"ftv_TheDesignNetwork_us","title":"Th